#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:4
#: 4e2dd16862ff48088c5a0cfe6e9242c0
msgid "QuadPlane AUTO Missions"
msgstr "QuadPlane AUTO 任务"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:6
#: 9bc2493a027b4483835154270774000c
msgid ""
"You can ask the QuadPlane code to fly :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` missions, with"
" everything from automatic vertical takeoff, to mixtures of fixed wing and "
"VTOL waypoints and automated VTOL landings. The result is an extremely "
"versatile aircraft capable of long range missions with vertical takeoff and "
"landing."
msgstr ""
"您可以让 QuadPlane 代码执行 :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` 任务，涵盖从自动垂直起飞，到固定翼与 VTOL "
"航点混合，以及自动 VTOL 降落等各种功能。其结果是一架极为多功能的飞机，能够实现具备垂直起降的远程任务飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:16
#: 07d6b67343ee40cba38f9b0f0a114eae
msgid "AUTO VTOL Takeoff"
msgstr "AUTO VTOL 起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:18
#: 2ce94ca321534899938d33c1c9c09d55
msgid ""
"The most common use of VTOL mission commands in a QuadPlane is an automatic "
"VTOL takeoff. To use a VTOL takeoff you plan your auto mission as usual with"
" your ground stations mission editor, but instead of a NAV_TAKEOFF command "
"for a fixed wing takeoff you instead use a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF command for a "
"VTOL takeoff."
msgstr ""
"在 QuadPlane 任务命令中，最常见的用途是自动 VTOL 起飞。要使用 VTOL 起飞，您需要在地面站任务编辑器中规划任务，但用 "
"NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 命令代替固定翼起飞的 NAV_TAKEOFF 命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:24
#: d29606cd586f44188c03c8b0087b4c41
msgid ""
"The only parameter to a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF is the altitude above the takeoff "
"point where the takeoff is complete. When executed, the aircraft will start "
"climbing at :ref:`Q_WP_SPEED_UP<Q_WP_SPEED_UP>`. Once that altitude is "
"reached the aircraft will move to the next waypoint, transitioning to fixed "
"wing flight as needed. The latitude and longitude of the NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF "
"command is ignored."
msgstr ""
"NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 唯一的参数是起飞完成时相对于起飞点的高度。执行时，飞机将以 "
":ref:`Q_WP_SPEED_UP<Q_WP_SPEED_UP>` "
"的速度开始爬升。到达该高度后，飞机将移动到下一个航点，并根据需要切换到固定翼飞行。NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 命令的经纬度将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:31
#: ed840bd947c74aeda85da6ba48dc7d9e
msgid ""
"If a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF is executed when already flying, the vehicle will "
"enter VTOL mode and climb the amount given in the altitude parameter, above "
"its current altitude. This behavior can be modified by using the \"respect "
"takeoff frames\" bit of the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bitmask which will "
"skip to the next command if already at or above the altitude set in the "
"parameter, or climb to it."
msgstr ""
"如果在已飞行状态下执行 NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF，飞行器将进入 VTOL 模式并在当前高度基础上爬升高度参数所指定的量。此行为可通过 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` "
"位掩码中的「遵守起飞框架」位来修改，若已处于或高于参数所设高度，将跳到下一条命令，否则将爬升至该高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:33
#: 3a9849cec5bd4df6995b0b5f327e535b
msgid ""
"In order to prevent the landing gear from dragging due to GPS noise at the "
"beginning of the takeoff, you can set :ref:`Q_NAVALT_MIN<Q_NAVALT_MIN>` to a"
" non zero value which will force the roll and pitch to be zero until that "
"altitude is reached. At which point, navigation (ie loiter in position "
"during the takeoff climb) will become active."
msgstr ""
"为防止起飞初期因 GPS 噪声导致起落架拖地，可将 :ref:`Q_NAVALT_MIN<Q_NAVALT_MIN>` "
"设为非零值，在达到该高度之前强制横滚和俯仰保持为零。达到该高度后，导航（即起飞爬升期间的位置悬停）将变为激活状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:36
#: 01404c352a29414c8cc85b7bcabccc37
msgid "AUTO VTOL Landing"
msgstr "AUTO VTOL 降落"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:38
#: d11ec24317b74e0584313a9eaf366aa1
msgid ""
"There are several ways to perform an automatic VTOL landing. The simplest is"
" to include a NAV_VTOL_LAND command in your mission. That command should use"
" an altitude of zero, and have a latitude and longitude of the landing "
"position."
msgstr ""
"执行自动 VTOL 降落有几种方式。最简单的是在任务中包含一条 NAV_VTOL_LAND 命令，该命令高度应设为零，并设置降落位置的经纬度。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:44
#: 6d0c87724e624f2180cc21229f27a805
msgid "Versions prior to 4.1"
msgstr "4.1 版本之前"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:46
#: 3810f0916fc44691b735fa8cc02b9980
msgid ""
"In firmware version prior to 4.1 ,when using NAV_VTOL_LAND it is important "
"to have the right horizontal spacing between that waypoint and the previous "
"one. As soon as the aircraft starts on the NAV_VTOL_LAND waypoint it will "
"transition to VTOL flight, which means it will start flying much more slowly"
" than it does in fixed wing flight. So you need to put the previous waypoint"
" the right distance from the landing point. If it is too far from the "
"landing point then the aircraft will spend a lot of time in VTOL flight "
"which will waste battery. If it is too close to the landing point then it "
"will have to stop very abruptly in order to land."
msgstr ""
"在4.1之前的固件版本中，使用 NAV_VTOL_LAND 时，该航点与前一航点之间的水平间距非常重要。飞机一旦开始执行 NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"航点，就会切换到 VTOL 飞行，这意味着它将比固定翼飞行慢得多。因此需要将前一航点放在距降落点合适的距离处。若距离太远，飞机将在 VTOL "
"模式中飞行较长时间，浪费电池电量；若距离太近，则飞机将不得不非常突然地停下来才能降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:56
#: 9e2ab6d110c44624a7804009991723a1
msgid ""
"For most small QuadPlanes a distance of between 60 and 80 meters from the "
"last waypoint to the landing point is good. For larger faster flying "
"QuadPlanes you will need a larger distance."
msgstr ""
"对于大多数小型 QuadPlane，最后一个航点到降落点的距离在60到80米之间较为合适。对于尺寸更大、飞行速度更快的 "
"QuadPlane，则需要更大的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:60
#: 2f52961f80e340bb95e7509a0ed1820f
msgid ""
"Also make sure the altitude of the last waypoint is chosen to be within a "
"reasonable height of the landing. The VTOL landing approach will be done at "
"whatever height the aircraft is at when it starts on the NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"waypoint. So you would typically want the previous waypoint to have an "
"altitude of about 20 meters above the ground."
msgstr ""
"另外，请确保最后一个航点的高度选择在距降落点合理范围内。VTOL 降落进近将在飞机开始执行 NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"航点时的高度进行。因此通常希望前一航点的高度约为地面以上20米。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:66
#: b1e4ffd33d8e4bcaa1ac6bd685e84d18
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` is set for \"Use a fixed wing approach\" (bit"
" 4), then instead of transitioning to VTOL flight and doing a VTOL landing, "
"it will remain in plane mode , and proceed to the landing position, climbing"
" or descending to the altitude set in the NAV_VTOL_LAND waypoint. When it "
"reaches within :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` of the landing "
"location, it will perform a LOITER_TO_ALT to finish the climb or descent to "
"that altitude set in the waypoint and using "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` for the loiter radius , then, "
"turning into the wind, transition to VTOL mode and proceed to the landing "
"location and land."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 设置了「使用固定翼进近」（第4位），则飞机不会切换到 VTOL 飞行并进行 VTOL "
"降落，而是保持固定翼模式，飞向降落位置，同时爬升或下降至 NAV_VTOL_LAND 航点所设的高度。当到达距降落位置 "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 范围内时，将执行 LOITER_TO_ALT "
"以完成爬升或下降至航点所设高度，并使用 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 作为盘旋半径，然后迎风切换到"
" VTOL 模式，飞向降落位置并降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:68
#: 77bc480fa0214f9ea29b6b8231d5d79c
msgid ""
"Note that if :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` = 0, the waypoint "
"loiter radius will be used. Be sure to set the VTOL_LAND waypoint altitude "
"and :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` distance to avoid obstacles. "
"Note also, that if this waypoint is reached while in VTOL mode, it will "
"proceed as a normal VTOL_LAND command, even if the option is set."
msgstr ""
"注意，若 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` = 0，将使用航点盘旋半径。请确保设置 VTOL_LAND"
" 航点高度和 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 距离以避开障碍物。另外，如果在 VTOL "
"模式下到达此航点，即使设置了该选项，也将按正常 VTOL_LAND 命令执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:70
#: 86973362154f4247bb4e67cf162f980f
msgid ""
"Be sure that the NAV_VTOL_LAND is placed with enough distance to reach the "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>`, plus at least a 90 degree turn, "
"plus distance required to de-transition to VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"请确保 NAV_VTOL_LAND 的放置位置有足够距离，以满足到达 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>`"
" 所需的距离，加上至少90度转弯所需的距离，再加上切换到 VTOL 模式所需的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:75
#: 1785ea6913e84d3a995801aaf1cdf7fb
msgid "(figure courtesy of SRP AERO   https://srp.aero/)"
msgstr "（图片由 SRP AERO 提供 https://srp.aero/)"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:78
#: a54eeba52ea84128b554e752aa0d057d
msgid "Versions 4.1 and later"
msgstr "4.1 及更高版本"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:80
#: c2aef70e78d3444a87cec0aa6117427f
msgid ""
"By default a NAV_VTOL_LAND will remain in fixed mode at the current "
"altitude, until close to the landing point, execute an \"airbraking\" "
"maneuver to reduce speed, then transition to VTOL, navigate precisely to the"
" landing point, and descend as in QLAND to a landing. This allows setting "
"the NAV_VTOL_LAND point any distant away from the last waypoint without "
"having to worry about excessive time in VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，NAV_VTOL_LAND 将在当前高度保持固定翼模式，直到接近降落点，执行「气动制动」机动以降低速度，然后切换到 "
"VTOL，精确导航至降落点，并像 QLAND 一样下降着陆。这样无论 NAV_VTOL_LAND 点距最后一个航点多远，都不必担心在 VTOL "
"模式中耗费过多时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:82
#: 030f4db3fe874f8ca3b470eeb4c77f46
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16 is set to disable the fixed wing "
"approach phase, then it will immediately transition to VTOL when the command"
" is executed and navigate to the landing point in VTOL mode. This requires "
"the careful setup of the last waypoint before this command to avoid a long "
"path to the landing point while in VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第16位被设置以禁用固定翼进近阶段，则执行命令时将立即切换到 VTOL，并在 VTOL "
"模式下导航至降落点。这需要仔细设置此命令前的最后一个航点，以避免在 VTOL 模式下飞行过长的路径至降落点。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:84
#: 26e46c4d44c543e9add720b813ede277
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 is set, then even if bit 16 is set, the"
" vehicle will execute the fixed wing approach and loiter to altitude, "
"described above in the previous section, before changing to VTOL mode. If "
"bit 16 is also set, then when the vehicle switches to VTOL mode, it will "
"attempt to do the airbrake maneuver and QLAND for that final segment."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` "
"第4位被设置，则即使第16位也被设置，飞行器也将先执行固定翼进近和盘旋降高（如前一节所述），再切换到 VTOL 模式。如果第16位也被设置，则切换到 "
"VTOL 模式时，将尝试执行气动制动机动并在最后阶段使用 QLAND 降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:87
#: 35abf4b2856c41979cc405d0f6dd23f1
msgid "Return to Launch"
msgstr "返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:89
#: b9d15a2813a24b9fb612831b2f03b865
msgid ""
"An alternative to using a NAV_VTOL_LAND command is to use a RETURN_TO_LAUNCH"
" command, and to set the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` parameter to 1."
msgstr ""
"使用 NAV_VTOL_LAND 命令的另一种方式是使用 RETURN_TO_LAUNCH 命令，并将 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数设为1。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:92
#: cc4668b54ff7444ca2464162b7a82ed3
msgid ""
"The advantage of using a RETURN_TO_LAUNCH with :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>`"
" set is that the aircraft will automatically use fixed wing flight until it "
"gets within :ref:`RTL_RADIUS <RTL_RADIUS>` of the return point. That makes "
"it easier to plan missions with a VTOL landing from anywhere in the flying "
"area."
msgstr ""
"将 RETURN_TO_LAUNCH 与 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` "
"结合使用的优势在于，飞机将自动使用固定翼飞行，直到到达返回点的 :ref:`RTL_RADIUS <RTL_RADIUS>` "
"范围内。这使得在飞行区域任何位置规划 VTOL 降落任务变得更容易。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:102
#: 1aa4935edbd24c3bbe0825b0802d4059
msgid "Mixing VTOL and Fixed Wing Flight"
msgstr "混合 VTOL 与固定翼飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:104
#: c997cd72ba0c47b0a8dbb42a7b1ed3ef
msgid ""
"To mix fixed wing and VTOL flight in one mission you can use the "
"DO_VTOL_TRANSITION command in your mission. A DO_VTOL_TRANSITION command "
"takes a single parameter. If the parameter is set to 3 then the aircraft "
"will change to VTOL mode. If the parameter is set to 4 then it will change "
"to fixed wing mode."
msgstr ""
"要在一次任务中混合固定翼和 VTOL 飞行，可在任务中使用 DO_VTOL_TRANSITION 命令。DO_VTOL_TRANSITION "
"命令有一个参数：若参数设为3，飞机将切换到 VTOL 模式；若参数设为4，则切换到固定翼模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:113
#: f5b1684214224b8fb09e25ba824f82e3
msgid ""
"In the above example the aircraft will do a VTOL takeoff, then it will fly "
"to waypoint 1 as a fixed wing aircraft. It will then switch to VTOL mode and"
" fly as a VTOL aircraft through waypoints 4 and 5, then it will switch back "
"to fixed wing flight to reach waypoint 7, before finally flying home and "
"landing as a VTOL aircraft (assuming Q_RTL_MODE is set to 1)."
msgstr ""
"在上述示例中，飞机将先进行 VTOL 起飞，然后以固定翼飞机方式飞往航点1。然后切换到 VTOL 模式，以 VTOL "
"飞机方式飞过航点4和5，再切换回固定翼飞行到达航点7，最后以 VTOL 飞机方式飞回 Home 并降落（假设 Q_RTL_MODE 设为1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:121
#: ac99bc4d8df9415382ac64caa09c8eb1
msgid "Hovering in a Mission"
msgstr "任务中悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:123
#: ead711cb5f9e4745a27829e710014cc0
msgid ""
"By setting the :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` parameter to 1 your "
"quadplane will handle loiter commands in :ref:`GUIDED mode <guided-mode>` "
"and in AUTO missions as a VTOL aircraft. For example, the following mission:"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` 参数设为1，您的 quadplane 将在 :ref:`GUIDED 模式"
" <guided-mode>` 和 AUTO 任务中以 VTOL 飞行器的方式处理盘旋命令。例如，以下任务："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:131
#: 7d2f654d0b72478cbd3c57fd5789d69b
msgid ""
"the aircraft will pause while hovering for 10 seconds at waypoint 3. It will"
" fly the rest of the mission as a fixed wing aircraft. This can be very "
"useful for getting good photographs of a number of locations in a mission "
"while flying most of the mission as an efficient fixed wing aircraft."
msgstr ""
"飞机将在航点3处悬停10秒。其余任务段将以固定翼飞机方式飞行。这对于在任务中飞往多个地点拍摄高质量照片非常有用，同时大部分任务路程以高效的固定翼方式飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:138
#: 81060103a2f841a48ac479985de35027
msgid "Guided Mode"
msgstr "Guided 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:140
#: ef7e41198f084efcb81931cbb0185e1c
msgid ""
"In addition to AUTO mode, you can also use a QuadPlane in :ref:`GUIDED mode "
"<guided-mode>`. To use VTOL support in GUIDED mode you need to set the "
":ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` parameter to 1. When set, GUIDED mode "
"behaviour will change so that the position hold at the destination will be "
"done as a VTOL hover rather than a fixed wing circle."
msgstr ""
"除 AUTO 模式外，您也可以在 :ref:`GUIDED 模式 <guided-mode>` 中使用 QuadPlane。要在 GUIDED "
"模式中使用 VTOL 支持，需要将 :ref:`Q_GUIDED_MODE <Q_GUIDED_MODE>` 参数设为1。设置后，GUIDED "
"模式的行为将改变，使得到达目标位置后的位置保持以 VTOL 悬停方式执行，而非固定翼盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:147
#: aafe711967a041f8926e3f228c1edceb
msgid ""
"The approach to the guided waypoint will be done as a fixed wing aircraft. "
"The transition to VTOL flight will begin at the :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD "
"<WP_LOITER_RAD>` radius in meters. This should be set appropriately for your"
" aircraft. A value of 80 meters is good for a wide range of QuadPlanes."
msgstr ""
"飞往 Guided 航点的进近将以固定翼飞机方式进行。在距目标 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"半径（单位：米）处开始切换到 VTOL 飞行。请根据您的飞机适当设置此值，80米对于大多数 QuadPlane 均适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-auto-mode.rst:153
#: d52efd945d7f43429c41013a17f6b63d
msgid ""
"When hovering at the destination in GUIDED mode if a new GUIDED destination "
"is given then the aircraft will transition back to fixed wing flight, fly to"
" the new location and then hover again in VTOL mode."
msgstr ""
"在 GUIDED 模式下悬停于目标位置时，若发出新的 GUIDED 目标，飞机将切换回固定翼飞行，飞往新位置，然后再次在 VTOL 模式中悬停。"
